Standard exercises for opening the hip:

* clamshells with band, 2 sets per side
* 4-Figure Stand Stretch for 30 secs per side
* 4-Figure Stand keep upright for 30 secs per side
* Hip Airplanes
* Double Pidgeon or [[Fire log pose|https://youtube.com/shorts/bQWh4-MP1m4?si=B3JiZwgq46lJfJHV]]
* [[Groin Stretch|https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cIg1I5WN4l4]]